      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SZYSLAK (7) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 22.80 beating Crenshaw King. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. In form and can go on with it. AUSSIE GEM (8) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a strong early sectional and went on to clock 22.66 in a nose win at this track over 400m. One of the key runners again. WAVE OF FUN (4) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (22.93) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Expected to do much better this time. PARADISE PARIS (6) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
